error[SC0001]: `!` is not an operator in Science
  --> tests/ui/unknown_character.science:16:21
   |
16 |     let inverted be !true
   |                     ^ negation is spelled `not`
   |
   = note: `!` begins no operator in Science: inequality is `is not`
   = help: if you meant to negate, write: `not `
